  "tha-ap439:0.2": "",
  "tha-ap439:0.3": "55. 7. Ambāṭakadāyakattheraapadānaṃ ",
  "tha-ap439:1.1": "‘‘Vipine buddhaṃ disvāna, ",
  "tha-ap439:1.2": "sayambhuṃ aparājitaṃ; ",
  "tha-ap439:1.3": "Ambāṭakaṃ gahetvāna, ",
  "tha-ap439:1.4": "sayambhussa adāsahaṃ. ",
  "tha-ap439:2.1": "56. ‘‘Ekatiṃse ito kappe, ",
  "tha-ap439:2.2": "yaṃ phalamadadiṃ tadā; ",
  "tha-ap439:2.3": "Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, ",
  "tha-ap439:2.4": "phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ. ",
  "tha-ap439:3.1": "57. ‘‘Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ…pe… ",
  "tha-ap439:3.2": "",
  "tha-ap439:3.3": "viharāmi anāsavo. ",
  "tha-ap439:4.1": "58. ‘‘Svāgataṃ vata me āsi…pe… ",
  "tha-ap439:4.2": "",
  "tha-ap439:4.3": "kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ. ",
  "tha-ap439:5.1": "59. ‘‘Paṭisambhidā catasso…pe… ",
  "tha-ap439:5.2": "",
  "tha-ap439:5.3": "kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ’’. ",
  "tha-ap439:6.1": "Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ambāṭakadāyako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti. ",
  "tha-ap439:7.1": "Ambāṭakadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ. "
}
